    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "C99A4A82D0940AE8",
      "text": "...\\n...[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "C99A4D82D0941001",
      "text": "As-tu remarqué un quelconque déséquilibre\\nchez monsieur Agrou, dernièrement ?[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "C3836108EE7B8717",
      "text": "Il est très en forme !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "C3836208EE7B88CA",
      "text": "Il adore voler !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "C99A4C82D0940E4E",
      "text": "C’est un soulagement.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "C99A4F82D0941367",
      "text": "Il avait ingéré une grande quantité de comprimés\\nd’un coup. Cela me préoccupait.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "C99A4E82D09411B4",
      "text": "Heureusement, monsieur Agrou semble posséder\\nune constitution suffisamment robuste, ce qui\\r\\nlui a permis de supporter l’ingestion.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "C99A5182D09416CD",
      "text": "Cependant, d’après ma conjecture, cela aurait\\npu s’avérer dangereux pour n’importe quel\\r\\nautre Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "C99A5082D094151A",
      "text": "Il ne s’agit que d’une hypothèse, bien entendu.\\c\\nMon Airmure me permet de m’adonner à la\\ncourse aérienne contre la montre sans difficulté.\\c\\nL’occasion d’expérimenter davantage ne s’est\\ndonc pas présentée.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 208,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_08",
      "hash64": "C99A4382D093FF03",
      "text": "Je n’ai plus d’informations à te transmettre.\\nNous pouvons conclure cette discussion.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "F484C1778787444C",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Une question me taraude.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "F484C277878745FF",
      "text": "Comment as-tu fait la connaissance de Kassis ?[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "D2A78799FC4F6886",
      "text": "Lors de mon voyage scolaire !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "D2A78699FC4F66D3",
      "text": "Nous étions ensemble à Septentria.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "F484C377878747B2",
      "text": "C’est donc à cette occasion que vous vous\\nêtes rencontrés...\\c\\nIl est vrai qu’il était rentré à Septentria,\\navant sa transformation capillaire.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "04DFF41B4ADF0670",
      "text": "E-ensemble ?!\\n... Hum, pardonne mon emportement.\\c\\nTu parles de l’équipe que vous avez dû former\\ndans le cadre des activités du voyage scolaire.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "F484C47787874965",
      "text": "Vois-tu, je m’interroge au sujet de Kassis et\\ndes vives émotions que tu semblais susciter\\r\\nchez lui...[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "F484BD7787873D80",
      "text": "Mais je ne constate aucune singularité dans\\nles circonstances de votre rencontre.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "F484BE7787873F33",
      "text": "C’est tout pour le moment.\\nJe te remercie beaucoup.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "F12997725EAB7B3D",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\nJe souhaiterais solliciter ton avis.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "F12996725EAB798A",
      "text": "Je suis en proie à des sensations inexplicables...[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "F12995725EAB77D7",
      "text": "Il m’arrive d’avoir mal dans la poitrine, ou encore\\nde perdre l’appétit.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "F12994725EAB7624",
      "text": "Néanmoins, le diagnostic établi à l’infirmerie\\nne fait état d’aucune anomalie.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "F12993725EAB7471",
      "text": "Peut-être est-ce un changement physiologique ?[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "56E9BF2FE7EA6109",
      "text": "Tu n’as aucune idée de la raison ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "56E9BC2FE7EA5BF0",
      "text": "Quand cela t’arrive-t-il ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "F12992725EAB72BE",
      "text": "Pas la moindre. Je ne suis parvenue à formuler\\naucune hypothèse.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_05b",
      "hash64": "7516B456DD542BD4",
      "text": "Je n’ai pu déterminer aucune régularité\\ndans la fréquence de ces occurrences.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "F12991725EAB710B",
      "text": "J’ai néanmoins remarqué que... ces symptômes\\nse manifestent lorsque je songe à Kassis...[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_07",
      "hash64": "F12990725EAB6F58",
      "text": "Mais ces faits sont simplement concomitants.\\nIl n’y a là aucune causalité, à mon avis.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_08",
      "hash64": "F1298F725EAB6DA5",
      "text": "*soupir* ...[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "88C64154CA3E800F",
      "text": "Quoi qu’il en soit, j’ai également observé que les\\nsymptômes s’atténuent quand je discute avec toi.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "88C64054CA3E7E5C",
